# Story page: nm-hive
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: The Swarm
---
The hum became a roar. The roar became a sky.

{name} curled itself into a fortress of coils, and the wasps crashed against it, again and again, like the sea against a very small and very nervous lighthouse.

'Everything wants a piece of you,' said the coil. 'Be glad. It means you are worth something.' I am not glad. I am stung.
